\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Holy Spirit, hear us;
\par Help us while we sing;
\par Breath into the music
\par Of the praise we bring.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Holy Spirit, prompt us 
\par When we kneel to pray;
\par Nearer come, and teach us
\par What we ought to say.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Holy Spirit, shine Thou 
\par On the Book we read;
\par Gild its holy pages
\par With the light we need.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Holy Spirit, give us 
\par Each a lowly mind;
\par Make us more like Jesus,
\par Gentle, pure, and kind
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Holy Spirit, brighten 
\par Little deeds of toil;
\par And our playful pastimes
\par Let no anger spoil.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Holy Spirit, help us 
\par Daily by Thy might,
\par What is wrong to conquer,
\par And to choose the right. \tab 
\par                          Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

